# Contract addresses are not env vars — they're public and live in src/lib/config.ts
# (FACTORY_ADDRESS, BUNDLER_ADDRESS). The fee wallet is read from the factory on-chain.
#
# Everything below is OPTIONAL and server-only (never sent to the browser).

# Higher TON RPC limits — free key from @tonapibot on Telegram (recommended for mainnet)
TONCENTER_API_KEY=
# Higher TonAPI limits — free key from tonconsole.com
TONAPI_KEY=
# Enables Telegram login, the Mini App and the bot. After deploying, open
# https://<your-site>/api/telegram/setup once to connect the bot.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
